<title>HUNGARY: TOP 10 HUNGARY BROKER BY STOCKS TURNOVER. [CORRECTED 12:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>TOP 10 HUNGARY BROKER BY STOCKS TURNOVER. [CORRECTED 12:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to show that ABN Amro Hoare Govett is 4th on the list, not Concorde Ertekpapir.)</p>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange</p>
<p>published on Wednesday rankings for Hungarian brokerages by</p>
<p>turnover in the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>List of top ten brokerages by H1 1996 turnover in shares</p>
<p>follows.</p>
<p>  (MILLION FORINTS)					 Stocks</p>
<p>  1. Internationale Nederlanden Ertekpapir	55,318.1</p>
<p>  2. Creditanstalt Ertekpapir			 45,327.6</p>
<p>  3. Credit Suisse First Boston		     14,037.2</p>
<p>  4. ABN Amro Hoare Govett			     7,579.7</p>
<p>  5. Concorde Ertekpapir				 6,912.9</p>
<p>  6. Bank Austria-GiroCredit			   5,662.2</p>
<p>  7. OTP Ertekpapir					4,252.4</p>
<p>  8. Postabank Ertekpapir				4,214.2</p>
<p>  9. Elso Magyarorszagi Nemet Ertekpapir	   4,112.9</p>
<p> 10. Elso Magyar-Angol Ertekpapir		    4,090.5</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
